- npm.cmd run typecheck --workspace @hireheaven/web - passed.
- ESLint on apps/web/src/app/(public)/page.tsx - passed.
- User-service logs and database catalog inspection confirmed the missing
  profiles relation and user-schema migration mismatch.
- Both the container and local migration attempts failed at the existing
  skills relation (PostgreSQL 42P07); no migration completed and no schema
  changes were made by these failed attempts.
- The migration preflight passes JavaScript syntax, ESLint, and a registration
  check confirming the guard is queued before table creation.
- `npm.cmd run test --workspace @hireheaven/user -- src/tests/user.test.ts
  src/tests/assetUpload.test.ts` - passed, 14 tests.
- `npm.cmd run test --workspace @hireheaven/utils -- src/tests/upload.test.ts` -
  passed, 11 tests.
- `npm.cmd run typecheck --workspace @hireheaven/user` - passed.
